# Benchmark outputs. The per-seed JSON records in results/ are meant to be
# committed with the code that produced them (each carries its git commit);
# everything else there (per-sample .npz arrays, plots) stays out of git -
# the arrays belong in the Zenodo archive.
results/*
!results/*.json

# Downloaded datasets and cached observables / EFPs (large; regenerate locally)
data/
